imagine if you could walk to work each  morning stop at the local coffee shop  and still have time to Pat Winston  imagine if you could talk to your best  friend all day and go to lunch with the  Senior Partners overlooking the bay  believe it or not here at Lincoln's we  have made it possible and we are living  our life beyond numbers founded in 1951  and located in Albany  Western Australia Lincoln's provides an  unprecedented accounting experience due  to the family life bond present amongst  the 40 staff members you can usually  spot us on the weekends exploring the  stunning surroundings Albany has to  offer from the Strawberry Hill Farm to  Middleton Beach's breathtaking views  Albany has it all even a wind farm which  keeps everything running smoothly  much like our support team without them  we would be in the dark behind closed  doors you'll find more than a few teams  like Gary's team who specialize in  succession planning and agriculture gary  is known as a class clown in the office  this is Rob's team Rob is a hardcore  nature lover his team specializes in  pharmacies in the wine industry this is  Craig stone Kraig is our office handyman  his team specializes in the agriculture  and construction industry this is  Brendan's team brendan is our in-house  pilot and can take us all over the state  his team specializes in farming  manufacturing and transport and this  this is Russell's team his team  specializes in business advisory audit  governance and superannuation Russell is  our longest serving partner and loves  adventure we even have our own in-house  bookkeeping team they like to keep  things in  with so many teams we like to celebrate  our accomplishments as one each end of  financial year our five partners come  together to create extraordinary  surprise parties going above and beyond  for each staff member on the day which  over the years has created countless  friendships and endless memories but had  gala dinners murder mysteries mastership  woodstock battle of the bands and  everything in between  it's these events that have truly  brought us together and made us lifelong  friends even those who have left us to  pursue other goals return to Albany to  celebrate at our amazing reunion every  employee since day one was invited to  celebrate Lincoln's no matter how many  faces come and go or how large we grow  here at Lincoln's we will continue  living our life beyond numbers
 

